                <pb facs="1143" n="1063" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg1063"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bowen to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-04-23"><hi rendition="#italic">April 23,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Bowen reports that the minister for foreign affairs says that Venezuelan war
                    ships are compelled by the Venezuelan code to capture as contraband any ship not
                    duly cleared by Venezuelan consuls.)</p>
            </div>
